#: svelte/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Vite + Svelte app styled with [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"and [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(icon action + token reads).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `register()` (from `@pantoken/svelte`) once at "
"bootstrap so elements like\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token CSS plus "
"`@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `src/App.svelte`'s markup is styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Vite + Svelte forrit stílað með [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"og [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(táknaaðgerðir + táknalestur).\n"
"\n"
"## Þróun\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Hvað er hér\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` kallar `register()` (frá `@pantoken/svelte`) einu sinni við "
"ræsingu svo þættir eins og\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` virka í sniðmótum, og innflytja táknakröfunum CSS og "
"`@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (tengir saman modal, tooltip og aðra hegðun íhluta beint úr kassanum).\n"
"- `src/App.svelte`'s merking er stíluð með `instui-*` flokkum; valkvæðir "
"innsetningarpunktar (haus,\n"
"  síar, innihald, eftirfarandi) eru merktir með `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Notaðu flokka eins og `class=\"instui-button\"` á merkingu; sjá\n"
"  [íhlutaviðmiðun](https://pantoken.app/api/css) fyrir fullan flokkalista.\n"
"\n"
"## Læra meira\n"
"\n"
"Sjá [leiðbeiningar til að hefjast handa](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-"
"started) til að læra meira.\n"

